#==============================================================================================
#
#   grid_formatting_context_5 - Layout::GridFormattingContext: item alignment and sizes,
#                               gutters, box metrics, collapsed auto-fit tracks and grid areas
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/GridFormattingContext.cpp (lines 1613-2056): the alignment of an
#       item in either axis (justify-self / align-self, with `auto` taken from the container's
#       justify-items / align-items), the used size and margins of every item in its grid area
#       (auto margins, alignment, stretching, min and max sizes, replaced elements and aspect
#       ratios), the gutters' sizes under justify-content / align-content, the items' padding,
#       margins and borders, collapsing empty auto-fit tracks, and the rectangle of an item's
#       grid area (or of the augmented grid's padding edges for an absolutely positioned item).
#
#       Copyright (c) 2023-2025, Aliaksandr Kalenik <kalenik.aliaksandr@gmail.com>
#       Copyright (c) 2022-2023, Martin Falisse <mfalisse@outlook.com>
